id: pm-jev-hx9w
title: Fit and validate repository-separated decision calibration
description: "Temperature scaling with repository-held-out validation, precision-qualified thresholds, SDK settings receipts and calibrated decision integration."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: added,calibration
created_at: "2026-10-18T03:02:22.167Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T05:43:03.895Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Temperature and threshold selection use calibration repositories only and validate on distinct repositories; SDK-locked settings preserve unrelated keys and pin task/model/data/question identities; compatible decisions use calibrated probabilities, enforce qualification and stricter explicit thresholds, retain legacy behavior without a fit, and report receipts; bounded public-data acceptance and measured README results are committed."
parent: pm-jev-0w3q
dependencies[3]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-jev-2mg8,related,"2026-10-18T03:03:33.416Z",codex-agent,"cli:update:dep",detected
